  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/fb44581e3205bd40b398deb02d9385dc4f775854.png\" alt=\"自然纹理包标题\"></p><h1>自然纹理包</h1><hr><a href=\"\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub赞助\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbrandonitaly\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n  <img alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a><p>为你的世界赋予更自然的观感。一款基于柔和色彩与线条的纹理包。</p><p>此纹理包包含方块、物品、生物及用户界面的精细纹理，在保持原版游戏风格的基础上，带来更精致的视觉体验。</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/7485212caea176aedfec6dedeefdd8c379af8a5e.jpeg\" alt=\"世界预览\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/8385b990fc6950736db75dd81bafe71a1b4d2164.png\" alt=\"樱花树林\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/b6e9a1e2c16c84ba0f947ca28611c4843feddcf3.png\" alt=\"平原村庄\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/5952ce907b652378717f5052b26468323544dbb6.png\" alt=\"一只骆驼与一只灰猫坐在沙漠中\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/11769a64aca6bfac821faf64cfc7ba7b9c74ceb3.png\" alt=\"珊瑚礁\"></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/wl6YG9AY/images/02c27694a1daf11cf61a4d1c7afe4b110edf08ed.png\" alt=\"用户界面\"></p><hr><p>此资源包移植自《遗产主机版》的自然纹理包，并采用了《基岩版》的更新纹理。原始纹理由4J Studios制作。</p>",
